.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-remote-revision-patch 1  "geectl-remote-revision-patch 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-revision\-patch \- Show the per\-file diff of one revision against the previous one. Computed client\-side from per\-file reads (the library lists both revisions and cats each changed file); a differing binary file fails the call
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote revision\-patch\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> <\fIPACKAGE\fR> <\fIREV\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the per\-file diff of one revision against the previous one. Computed client\-side from per\-file reads (the library lists both revisions and cats each changed file); a differing binary file fails the call
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project the package lives in
.TP
<\fIPACKAGE\fR>
The package to diff
.TP
<\fIREV\fR>
The revision whose changes to show
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
